  "notes": "The yearly coupon of each tradable government bond series the Ministry of Finance sold at auction in 2026, as the auction file prints it (column COUPON, percent a year). Each observation's key is \"<BONDS>|<SERIES>|<REDEMTIONDATE>|<ORIGINALTERMTOMATURITY>\" as the file prints them: the bond type ('ממשלתית צמודה', CPI-linked, GOV-11; 'ממשלתית', fixed-rate shekel, GOV-13), the TASE series number, the redemption date and the original term in years. The date is the auction (ISSUANCEDATE). A series' coupon is fixed for its life (GOV-11, GOV-13), so for each key the file keeps its first 2026 auction and its latest; the auctions in between print the same coupon. Left out: the floating-rate type ('ממשלתית בריבית משתנה', GOV-14), whose printed coupon changes from period to period; and 21 rows that print COUPON 0 for a series whose other rows print its coupon (series 1233782 (7 rows), 1237205 (7 rows), 1241991 (7 rows): the first weeks each series was sold in 2026), which are not taken as a coupon of zero. Read 2026-11-14 from the file as published on 2026-11-13 (resource last modified 2026-11-13T05:00), 1,973 rows, the latest auction 2026-11-10.",
